A story across groups

The group `Shop` holds `Cart` and `Checkout`. The group `Bank` holds `Gateway`.
Write the story `pay`: the `Cart` passes to `Checkout` with the label
`hand over`, and `Checkout` calls the `Gateway` with the label `charge`. Show
it as a sequence.
---
Shop { Cart, Checkout }
Bank { Gateway }
story pay {
  Cart -> Checkout: hand over
  Checkout -> Gateway: charge
}
show sequence of pay
